## 🔧 Troubleshooting Checklist

When dropdown events aren't working:

- [ ] ✅ **Ref is properly attached**: `ref={dropdownRef}`
- [ ] ✅ **Event listener is attached**: `addEventListener("itemSelect", handler)`
- [ ] ✅ **Cleanup function exists**: `removeEventListener` in return
- [ ] ✅ **Dependencies are correct**: Include all used variables in useEffect deps
- [ ] ✅ **Component is client-side**: `"use client"` directive present
- [ ] ✅ **Hydration is handled**: Mounted state prevents SSR mismatches
- [ ] ✅ **Event name is correct**: Check Modus docs for exact event names
- [ ] ✅ **Debug logs are added**: Console.log to verify event firing
- [ ] ✅ **TypeScript types are correct**: Proper event and ref typing

## 📚 Related Patterns

This pattern applies to all interactive Modus Web Components:

